==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Meowth}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Alolan Meowth|51}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos|Sun & Moon Black Star Promos}}; both cards have the Scratch attack.
*{{m|Scratch}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Alolan Meowth can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

